}
```
But that's a lot. The desktop HUD at 844x390 leaves top ~105 (hud-top bottom maybe 113) and speedo 158 at bottom left. Minimap hidden; right side free for controls. It's playable. The leaderboard overlaps top-left and timing top-right but they don't cover the center too much. We can leave.

### 5. Touch controls for coarse pointer at >760
Base styling and show on pointer coarse. At 844x390, short-height override hides minimap and moves controls bottom right. At 1024x600 (tablet), controls show bottom 120, speedo and minimap; fine. At 1280x800 touchscreen laptop with coarse pointer, controls show? The media query `(hover:hover) and (pointer:fine)` might not match if primary pointer coarse, so yes, controls show. That's fine for a tablet.

But note: On **desktop Chrome**, `pointer: fine` and `hover:hover`, so hidden. Good.

