The modal at 390 height: content 493px vs 364. Need to save ~130px. Options:
- Reduce hero h2 font (currently 34px from mobile) and results-place span 62px.
- Reduce results grid stats to 4 columns in one row (height ~60 vs 2 rows ~120) — save 60px.
- Reduce results table row padding (10 rows ~? For 4 rows, each ~26px = 104).
- Hide results-summary paragraph? That's ~20px.
- Make action buttons horizontal (already flex row by default? At max-width 760 media results-actions flex-direction column, but 844 width > 760 so desktop: flex row; height ~46). In landscape, the actions at 442-490 = 48 tall. Fine.
- Reduce padding and hide the results hero summary.

