.results-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }
.results-grid .result-stat:nth-child(3) { border-left: 1px solid var(--line-soft); border-top: 0; }
.results-grid .result-stat:nth-child(4) { border-top: 0; }
.results-actions { flex-direction: row; }
.results-actions .btn { min-height: 32px; }
```
Because max-width 760 block sets nth-child 3/4 borders, override. Add to short-screen block.

At 640 width, four stat columns ~150px each; "TOP SPEED 302 KM/H" should fit with 17px font. Good. Let's do it.

